t;:&quot;follow&quot;}" disabled=""><span>Follow</span></button></div></div></div><span class="font-[450] text-tertiary">Prince Horton</span></div></div></div><div class="lg:hidden"><div class="pt-2 text-[0.875rem]/[1.125rem] text-tertiary"><div class="inline-block"><time dateTime="2026-11-02T00:44:47.000Z">Mon, November 2, 2026 at 12:44 AM UTC</time></div></div></div></div><div class="ml-0 mt-2 flex items-center lg:ml-3 lg:mt-0"><div class="ml-0 mr-2"><div class="relative flex"><a data-ylk="elm:partnercta;evdesc:partner_tap;g:7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054;itc:0;sec:google-pub;tar:www.google.com;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;follow&quot;,&quot;yEventDescription&quot;:&quot;partner_tap&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;article_body&quot;,&quot;link_domain&quot;:&quot;www.google.com&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;follow_google&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;add to google&quot;}" href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=tech.yahoo.com" class="flex h-8 items-center gap-2 text-nowrap rounded-full px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-4 hover:no-underline border-tertiary bg-primary font-semibold text-tertiary uds-border-width-thin hover:bg-secondary" aria-label="Add to Preferred Sources on Google, opens in a new tab" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-3" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.yimg.com/dl/_next/static/media/googleIcon.0uvm080xk7bke.svg"/>Add to Preferred Sources</a></div></div><a data-ylk="elm:cmmt_open;elmt:cmnt;evdesc:comments_tap;g:7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054;itc:1;pos:0;sec:view-cmnts-cta;slk:comments;t4:ctrl;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;comment&quot;,&quot;yEventDescription&quot;:&quot;comments_tap&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:0,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;article_body&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;comments&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;comments_open&quot;}" href="#article-comments-7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054" class="inline-flex h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-tertiary bg-primary px-2.5 py-1.5 text-tertiary uds-border-width-thin hover:bg-secondary" aria-label="View comments"><span aria-hidden="true" class="contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-tertiary"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M14 2H2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3l3 3 3-3h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path></svg><span class="ymp-root"></span></span></a><div class="relative inline-flex items-center ml-2"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Share this article" class="inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-tertiary uds-border-width-thin bg-primary hover:bg-secondary" data-ylk="elm:expand;elmt:sh-mu;evdesc:share_tap;itc:1;sec:consolidated-share-popup;slk:share-menu-open;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;expand&quot;,&quot;yAffiliateService&quot;:&quot;sh-mu&quot;,&quot;yEventDescription&quot;:&quot;share_tap&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;consolidated-share-popup&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;share-menu-open&quot;}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="!fill-current !text-tertiary" height="12" type="share" width="12"><path d="M21 14.989a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5.999a1 1 0 0 1-1 1.001H3.001A1 1 0 0 1 2 21.988v-5.999a1 1 0 0 1 2 0v5h16v-5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1M12.001 1l5.714 5.347a.959.959 0 1 1-1.357 1.357l-3.357-3.357v12.642H11V4.347L7.643 7.704a.96.96 0 0 1-1.358-1.357z"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="hidden lg:block"><div class="pt-2 text-[0.875rem]/[1.125rem] text-tertiary"><div class="inline-block"><time dateTime="2026-11-02T00:44:47.000Z">Mon, November 2, 2026 at 12:44 AM UTC</time></div></div></div></div></header><div class="md:mb-4 py-4 empty:mb-4 empty:py-0 md:py-0 md:pt-2 md:empty:pt-0 px-4 md:px-0"></div></div><div id="article-outer-7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 mx-auto md:max-w-[1118px] md:px-10 md:grid-cols-[[main-start]_1fr_[main-end_right-start]_min-content_[right-end]]"><div class="md:col-main" data-i13n-boundary="true"><div id="article-body-7a8a5c17-c2ef-3af2-ac41-0dcc1a06f054"><div class="grid grid-cols-article-mobile-fixed md:grid-cols-article-fullspan md:max-w-[690px]"><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Bruisers 2D Boxing is earning praise for its intense combat, deep career mode and unusual features. Here&#x27;s how to try it free.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">A $19.99 indie boxing game is drawing praise from fans of Fight Night and Undisputed. Bruisers 2D Boxing, which launched into Steam Early Access on October 21, combines retro pixel-art graphics with intense fighting and a surprisingly detailed career mode.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">After playing the game myself, I can understand the excitement. The punches feel impactful, exchanges are intense, and landing a clean shot is genuinely satisfying. Timing, stamina management and recognizing an opponent&#x27;s tendencies all matter.</p><figure class="relative col-body mb-2.5"><div class="relative"><img alt="" width="616" height="353" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-[12px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/59cb49d4e998e14772f55b118b14ac6db71a7a60fbf16c23f757aad9119618f1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w616_h353%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fathlon_sports_articles_610%2F7104ccf3c28b7b50dbf9b5e9462ee32d.jpg"/></div><figcaption class="relative text-[0.875rem]/[1.25rem] uds-font-size-legal1 uds-line-height-legal1 line-clamp-2 mt-3 pr-0 text-tertiary"><div><span class="[&amp;_p]:inline"><p>FunOldGamesFunOldGames</p></span></div></figcaption></figure><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Steam reviewer Kamin28 compared the experience to EA&#x27;s discontinued boxing franchise.</p><div class="mb-4 col-fullbleed bg-secondary pb-5 md:invisible md:mb-0 md:h-0 md:overflow-hidden md:pb-0 dark:bg-tertiary"><div class="py-2 text-center text-xs uppercase">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full flex-nowrap justify-center"><div class="flex" id="_R_pj6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_pj6dimmhbstabsnl9mtb_"></div><div class="flex size-full items-center justify-center bg-secondary text-center leading-3 text-secondary" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_pj6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: none; }
@media screen and (max-width: 767.95px) {
        #_R_pj6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><div class="col-body hidden dark:bg-tertiary [&amp;:has(iframe[height=&#x27;0&#x27;])]:mb-0 [&amp;:has(iframe[height=&#x27;0&#x27;])]:pb-0 md:block"><div class="flex w-full flex-nowrap justify-center"><div class="flex hidden w-full items-center justify-center" id="_R_19j6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_"><div class="flex w-full grow items-center justify-center" id="_R_19j6dimmhbstabsnl9mtb_"></div><style type="text/css">#_R_19j6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: none; }
@media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        #_R_19j6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">&quot;As someone who loved the old Fight Night series and was disappointed with what Undisputed turned into, this game scratches the itch perfectly,&quot; the reviewer wrote.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">The player even suggested the developers deserved enough funding to build a true Fight Night successor.</p><h2 class="heading-mb col-body heading-text-style font-bold charcoal-color">Bruisers 2D Boxing&#x27;s Career Mode Is Its Biggest Surprise</h2><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">The fighting is impressive, but the career mode might be the best I&#x27;ve experienced in a boxing game.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Players must manage training, nutrition, weight and physical health while building their careers. Unlike traditional boxing games, decisions outside the ring can have lasting consequences.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">The game also explores boxing&#x27;s darker side. Players can gamble, accept money to throw fights and use illegal tactics to gain an advantage.</p><div class="mb-4 col-fullbleed bg-secondary pb-5 md:invisible md:mb-0 md:h-0 md:overflow-hidden md:pb-0 dark:bg-tertiary"><div class="py-2 text-center text-xs uppercase">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full flex-nowrap justify-center"><div class="flex" id="_R_rb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_rb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtb_"></div><div class="flex size-full items-center justify-center bg-secondary text-center leading-3 text-secondary" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_rb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: none; }
@media screen and (max-width: 767.95px) {
        #_R_rb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">YouTube creator <a data-ylk="slk:eyegameuwatch;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;evdesc:context_link_tap;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;eyegameuwatch&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;article_body&quot;,&quot;yEventDescription&quot;:&quot;context_link_tap&quot;}" href="https://youtu.be/tZ1ll0XFP-U?si=PrCoONqTit3vtku7" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">eyegameuwatch</a> highlighted features such as removing glove padding, adding plaster-like material to increase damage and applying oil to impair an opponent&#x27;s vision. Opponents can reportedly use these same tactics.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Blood and facial swelling can also obstruct vision during fights, adding another layer of difficulty.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Career progression doesn&#x27;t stop at winning championships, either. Steam reviewer RONIN described watching a champion decline with age, eventually changing fighting styles before retiring undefeated.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">The career mode remains unfinished, and some players have criticized repetitive training minigames. However, the developers have already made improvements to auto-training.</p><div class="card-loader relative mb-2.5 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2px] p-2.5 shadow-[0_1px_2px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,.08),0-1px_3px_0_rgba(0,0,0,.06)] before:block before:h-[110px] before:bg-secondary before:content-[&#x27;_&#x27;] after:absolute after:left-0 after:top-0 after:size-full after:content-[&#x27;_&#x27;] col-body" data-pw="loader" style="aspect-ratio:1.78"><div class="mb-2.5 mt-6 h-full bg-placeholder-text bg-[length:40px_40px]"></div></div><h2 class="heading-mb col-body heading-text-style font-bold charcoal-color">How to Try Bruisers 2D Boxing for Free</h2><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Bruisers 2D Boxing costs $19.99 on Steam, but a free demo lets players experience the fighting before purchasing.</p><div class="mb-4 col-fullbleed bg-secondary pb-5 md:invisible md:mb-0 md:h-0 md:overflow-hidden md:pb-0 dark:bg-tertiary"><div class="py-2 text-center text-xs uppercase">Advertisement</div><div class="flex w-full flex-nowrap justify-center"><div class="flex" id="_R_tb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_tb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtb_"></div><div class="flex size-full items-center justify-center bg-secondary text-center leading-3 text-secondary" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_tb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: none; }
@media screen and (max-width: 767.95px) {
        #_R_tb6dimmhbstabsnl9mtbH1_ { display: flex; }
        iframe { max-width: 100vw; }
      }</style></div></div></div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">To download it:</p><ol class="col-body mb-4" start="1"><li class="ml-4 safari:ml-6 list-decimal"><div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Visit the <a data-ylk="slk:Bruisers 2D Boxing Steam page;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;evdesc:context_link_tap;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Bruisers 2D Boxing Steam page&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;article_body&quot;,&quot;yEventDescription&quot;:&quot;context_link_tap&quot;}" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3740090/" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Bruisers 2D Boxing Steam page</a>.</p></div></li><li class="ml-4 safari:ml-6 list-decimal"><div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Find &#x27;Download Bruisers 2D Boxing Demo.&#x27;</p></div></li><li class="ml-4 safari:ml-6 list-decimal"><div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Click &#x27;Download&#x27; and follow Steam&#x27;s installation instructions.</p></div></li></ol><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">The demo focuses on boxing gameplay, while the full career mode requires purchasing the Early Access version.</p><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color">Bruisers might not have the presentation of Fight Night or Undisputed, but its impactful fighting and ambitious career mode make it a boxing game worth trying.</p><h2 class="heading-mb col-body heading-text-style font-bold charcoal-color">More Sports Video Game News</h2><ul class="col-body mb-4"><li class="ml-4 safari:ml-6 list-disc"><div><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color"><a data-ylk="slk:GTA 6 Has More Sports Activities Than You Might Expect — Here&#x